@startuml
title Durable commit protocol: prepare, begin, observe, advance
skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #334155
  LifeLineBorderColor #475569
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantBorderColor #334155
  ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
}
actor "F1r3sky user" as User #DBEAFE
participant "Embers API\nand deterministic kernel" as Embers #E0E7FF
database "F1r3drive\nencrypted artifacts" as Drive #DCFCE7
database "F1r3node / RSpace\nmetadata ledger" as Chain #FEF3C7
participant "External activity" as Effect #FCE7F3

User -> Embers: prepare signed run
Embers -> Drive: create request + revision-0\n(O_EXCL, fsync, publish, finality)
Drive --> Embers: content hash + capability hash
Embers --> User: prepared contract + hashes
User -> Chain: signed beginDurableRun
Chain --> Embers: finalized
loop bounded read-node visibility lag
  Embers -> Chain: getRun(runId)
  Chain --> Embers: missing, stale, or exact revision 0
end
Embers -> Effect: idempotent effect request
Effect --> Embers: signed observation
Embers -> Drive: persist outbox + observation + revision-1
Drive --> Embers: finalized artifact pointers
Embers -> Chain: advanceRun(pointers)\n[revision CAS: <latex>\nu_{\mathrm{expected}} = 0 \Rightarrow \nu' = 1</latex>]
Chain --> Embers: finalized
loop bounded postcondition observation
  Embers -> Chain: getRun(runId)
  Chain --> Embers: stale or exact revision 1
end
Embers --> User: result or qualified waits + run link
@enduml
